        "heading": "Join Our Team",
        "heading_size": "h3",
        "subheading": "",
        "content": "<p>At Pepper Home, we’re building more than just beautiful products—we’re creating a brand that inspires people to love where they live. We’re a collaborative, fast-moving team that values creativity, ownership, and thoughtful execution. Whether you’re designing, developing, or supporting our customers, you’ll have the opportunity to make a real impact and help shape the future of our brand. If you’re passionate about home, design, and delivering exceptional experiences, we’d love to hear from you.</p>",
